@startuml
' Campus admin sequence diagram for VibeCraft
skinparam backgroundColor #F8F3FF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #6D28D9
  LifeLineBorderColor #8B5CF6
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F5F3FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #7C3AED
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F3E8FF
  ActorBorderColor #7C3AED
  ActorBackgroundColor #EDE9FE
  BoxBorderColor #7C3AED
  BoxBackgroundColor #F8F3FF
  MessageAlign center
}

actor CampusAdmin
participant Browser
participant CampusDashboard
participant EventCreatePage
participant EventModel
participant UserModel
participant NotificationService
participant DeviceService

CampusAdmin -> Browser: Login as campus_admin
Browser -> CampusDashboard: Check role and access
alt Not campus admin or not authenticated
    CampusDashboard -> Browser: Redirect to home or login
    Browser -> CampusAdmin: Access denied fallback
else Authorized
    CampusDashboard -> UserModel: Load campus students and metrics
    UserModel --> CampusDashboard: Campus summary
    CampusDashboard -> CampusAdmin: Show dashboard
end

CampusAdmin -> EventCreatePage: Open create event page
EventCreatePage -> CampusAdmin: Request event details
CampusAdmin -> EventCreatePage: Fill title, description, date, capacity

alt Event form is valid
    EventCreatePage -> EventModel: Save new event
    EventModel --> EventCreatePage: Event created
    EventCreatePage -> CampusAdmin: Confirmation message
else Validation fails
    EventCreatePage -> CampusAdmin: Show validation errors and retry
end

CampusAdmin -> Browser: Open event list
Browser -> EventModel: Load published and upcoming campus events
EventModel --> Browser: Event details
Browser -> CampusAdmin: Display event schedule

alt Campus admin updates event
    CampusAdmin -> EventCreatePage: Modify event details
    EventCreatePage -> EventModel: Save changes
    EventModel --> EventCreatePage: Updated
else Event not found or removed
    EventCreatePage -> CampusAdmin: Show fallback not found message
end

CampusAdmin -> DeviceService: Issue or refresh wearable/device token
DeviceService -> UserModel: Attach device registration
UserModel --> DeviceService: Token stored
DeviceService --> CampusAdmin: Device token confirmed

alt Device registration fails
    DeviceService -> CampusAdmin: Show retry or error fallback
end

CampusAdmin -> NotificationService: Trigger campus-related notifications
NotificationService -> CampusAdmin: Delivery status
@enduml
